msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Focused"
msgstr "Fokussiert"

#. <span class="hint d-block">@T["Only the section of the current page is
#. open, and opening a section closes the others."]</span>
#: OrchardCore.Admin\Views\AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml:74
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid ""
"Only the section of the current page is open, and opening a section closes "
"the others."
msgstr ""
"Nur der Bereich der aktuellen Seite ist geöffnet. Beim Öffnen eines Bereichs"
" werden die anderen geschlossen."

#. <label for="@(menuBehaviorId)_Persistent" class="form-check-
#. label">@T["Persistent"]</label>
#: OrchardCore.Admin\Views\AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml:78
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid "Persistent"
msgstr "Dauerhaft"

#. <span class="hint d-block">@T["Sections stay open until you close them,
#. from page to page, so several can be open at once."]</span>
#: OrchardCore.Admin\Views\AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml:79
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid ""
"Sections stay open until you close them, from page to page, so several can "
"be open at once."
msgstr ""
"Bereiche bleiben seitenübergreifend geöffnet, bis Sie sie schließen, sodass "
"mehrere gleichzeitig geöffnet sein können."

#. <span class="hint">@T["The section holding the current page is always open,
#. whichever behavior is chosen."]</span>
#: OrchardCore.Admin\Views\AdminSettings.Edit.cshtml:81
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Admin.Views.AdminSettings.Edit"
msgid ""
"The section holding the current page is always open, whichever behavior is "
"chosen."
msgstr ""
"Der Bereich der aktuellen Seite bleibt unabhängig vom gewählten Verhalten "
"immer geöffnet."

